{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Constraint in Play Design.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Constraint in Play Design.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"constraint in play design constraint in play design","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Constraint in Play Design.md","fileName":"Constraint in Play Design.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Constraint in Play Design","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-21 00:27\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Play Design Elements]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Play Design Elements","Play Space","gamesdesignandplay.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Constraint in Play Design.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Constraint in Play Design.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"constraint in play design constraint in play design","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Constraint in Play Design.md","fileName":"Constraint in Play Design.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Constraint in Play Design","heading":"Constraint in Play Design","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"A play-design constraint limits the actions, objects, space, information, or resources available to a player. The limit creates a problem to interpret and work within, turning unrestricted activity into a field of meaningful alternatives.\n\nConstraint is productive when it clarifies what matters while leaving room for choice. A restriction that removes every viable response collapses the [[Play Space]], whereas a carefully placed limit can make strategy, skill, or expression legible.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Play Design Elements","Play Space","gamesdesignandplay.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Constraint in Play Design.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Constraint in Play Design.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"constraint in play design constraint in play design","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Constraint in Play Design.md","fileName":"Constraint in Play Design.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Constraint in Play Design","heading":"References","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"[[gamesdesignandplay.pdf]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Play Design Elements","Play Space","gamesdesignandplay.pdf"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""}]}